{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Memorize the cards. Capture the channel. Win!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Panama Canal Clash&quot; is a classic memorial game with geopolitical overtones! The Panama Canal has become the scene of a confrontation between the US and China. Choose your side and play out the key events in the struggle for the strategic waterway!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to find the paired cards that symbolize the influence of your faction. But be careful: memorizing the arrangement of the cards is one thing, but winning the battle for supremacy is quite another!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf Two sets of cards - 5 unique cards for each faction (USA vs China).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Pump up your memory - classic memory mechanics in a political setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Choose your side - become the economic wizard of the USA or the strategist of China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad Vivid cartoon illustrations - memorize events with a dose of irony!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Compete with friends - who can memorize and find all the paired cards faster?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will become the master of the Panama Canal? Everything will be decided in the game Panama Canal Clash!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2106040?t=1742485366","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2106040?t=1742485366","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106040/3ee118bf7cb58e723f25acf8d0ac8f1fb0bc0831/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742485366","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106040/3ee118bf7cb58e723f25acf8d0ac8f1fb0bc0831/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742485366","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Memorize the cards. Capture the channel. Win!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Panama Canal Clash&quot; is a classic memorial game with geopolitical overtones! The Panama Canal has become the scene of a confrontation between the US and China. Choose your side and play out the key events in the struggle for the strategic waterway!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to find the paired cards that symbolize the influence of your faction. But be careful: memorizing the arrangement of the cards is one thing, but winning the battle for supremacy is quite another!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf Two sets of cards - 5 unique cards for each faction (USA vs China).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Pump up your memory - classic memory mechanics in a political setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Choose your side - become the economic wizard of the USA or the strategist of China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfad Vivid cartoon illustrations - memorize events with a dose of irony!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Compete with friends - who can memorize and find all the paired cards faster?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who will become the master of the Panama Canal? Everything will be decided in the game Panama Canal Clash!</p>","developers":["Azimuth team"],"dlc":[3546780],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106040/header.jpg?t=1742485366","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><b